# Deployment scripts

Detail: `.cursor/docs/infrastructure.md`

## Layout

- `prepare-artifacts.sh` — Maven + zip static
- `build-and-deploy.sh` — orchestrates API/UI
- `proxmox/deploy-api.sh`, `deploy-ui.sh`, `join-tailscale.sh`
- Shared: `proxmox/lib/{load-env.sh,proxmox-remote.sh}`

## Conventions

- Load secrets from repo root `.env` via `load-env.sh`
- Remote Proxmox when `pct` not local: `PROXMOX_HOST`, `PROXMOX_PASSWORD`
- Quote systemd `Environment="KEY=value with spaces"`
- App dir: `/opt/stats-india`, user `stats-india`
- `--recreate` only on first of API+UI in `build-and-deploy.sh`

Match moneytree patterns in `../moneytree/deployment/proxmox/` when extending.
